While being sucessful in calling rapache from a plain html-file
( http://www.aq-me.de/brew/helloWorld3.html ), I didn't manage to get
the cookbook-application running. I get a report on the Mozilla
Javascript Error-Console:

 " Error: Ajax is not defined
Quelldatei: http://www.aquinas-marketing-engineering.de/useR2007.js
Line: 6 "

which is

" new  Ajax.Updater( 'plot', '/brew/useR2007plot.rhtml', "

I believe that I set the correct paths, but I deleted the line calling
some inexistent "prototype.js" from the file "useR2007.rhtml". Does
anybody have an idea whats going wrong? I'm a newbie to the world of
web programming, so I would be grateful for every hint... :)

Cheers and thanks in advance,
Gero

